369
00:21:45,040 --> 00:21:49,300
That we determine once and for all which should be protecting her highness.

370
00:21:49,300 --> 00:21:54,840
My Herschel and the nobility of my blood, or your hand-me-down Tharsis.

371
00:21:56,200 --> 00:22:00,440
In the presence of all here, Count Troyard, I challenge you to a duel.

372
00:22:19,300 --> 00:22:20,440
Just like that, count on us, let's go!

